<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}
  notes={`这是整个系统的结构。四层从上到下：数据接入负责把行情拉下来、复权、体检；策略层只产出一张月末目标权重表；回测引擎按份额法记账、算成本；输出层出指标表和图。\n层与层之间只通过 CSV 通信，所以每一层都能单独跑、单独验。举个例子，我换一只 ETF，只需要改数据层，回测和策略一行都不用动。\n右边是横切的三块：前视检查、实验脚本、审计脚本，它们不属于任何一层，但每次提交都会跑。`}
>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 6, background: '#1A3D6D' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 22, right: 60, fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8' }}>01 软件设计</Text>

  <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
    四层分开，每层都能单独跑、单独验
  </Text>
  <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 16 }} />

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 28, height: 466 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 396, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginBottom: 4 }}>
        层间只通过 CSV 通信：<br />换数据源不动回测，改策略不碰成交假设。
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 62, background: '#1A3D6D' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>数据接入</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>akshare 日线 → 自算后复权 → 体检</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 62, background: '#1A3D6D' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>策略 / 信号</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>价格 + 目标波动率 → 月末权重表</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 62, background: '#1A3D6D' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>回测引擎</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>份额法 + 次日成交 + 双边万 2</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 62, background: '#1A3D6D' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>结果输出</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>指标 CSV + 净值图 + 逐日序列</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 724, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Image src="assets/arch.png" style={{ width: 724, height: 396, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        图　系统架构：右侧虚线框为横切关注点，不属于任何一层，每次提交自动执行
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
